      "label": "exact interval coverage",
      "notes": [
        "1. Determine every training settlement boundary greater than `last_settled_key` and less than or equal to the reached key.",
        "2. Settle them earliest-first.",
        "3. Split a cycle at every injury, recovery, casualty, duty, deployment, location, command, supply, equipment, instructor, facility, or order change.",
        "4. Add earned EDU to the sparse bank.",
        "5. Pay point costs iteratively from the current score; recalculate cost after every point.",
        "6. Preserve all remainder credits.",
        "7. Apply whole-person qualification and experience flows without multiplying the permanent stat arrays.",
        "8. Advance `last_settled_key` only to the end of the final valid subreceipt.",
        "9. Create the exact next training settlement boundary.",
        "A compact receipt may cover multiple unchanged cycles only when it contains one ordered subreceipt per crossed cycle and reproduces the exact iterative result. `covered_cycles: 4` with four subreceipts is legal; one training award multiplied or labelled as four months is not."
      ],
      "record_id": "exact_interval_coverage"
